transfer window. The 100 ton goal also sets the structural load path for the lunar landing legs and payload bay doors. The statement frames the capability as enabling broader scientific and commercial payloads beyond government missions. Remember, we covered starship yesterday. Today's target moves that forward by sharpening the refueling and insulation questions still open. The schedule calls for three falcon 9 missions from vandenberg within the same week.

